The head of the dashboard, the search and the help: the search field, the
link to the page of help and the form to log out.  A GET form, so a
search is a link that can be kept.
-#}
<nav class="roxie-top">
<form class="roxie-search" method="get" action="/search" role="search">
<label for="q">Query</label>
<input id="q" name="q" type="search" value="{{ query }}" size="60" placeholder="host:server and level:error and time:last 24h and &#34;mariadb&#34;">
<button>Search</button>
<a class="roxie-help-link" href="/help">Help</a>
</form>
<form class="roxie-logout" method="post" action="/logout">
<input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="{{ csrf }}">
<button>Log out</button>
</form>
</nav>
